    "text": "The period of the function <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo></math> thus <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>x</mi><mi></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>As</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi